cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata below."
title: "Q-Rescue: Uncertainty-Aware Hybrid Quantum Optimization for Emergency Routing"
type: software
authors:
  - name: "Ahmed Abdelghafar Mohamed"
    affiliation: "Your official institution name"
abstract: >-
  A research software implementation and Streamlit MVP for uncertainty-aware
  candidate-route selection using classical travel-time prediction, conformal
  uncertainty, deadline-risk scoring, exact QUBO optimization, and ideal-simulator
  QAOA. The repository does not claim quantum advantage or operational emergency
  deployment readiness.
keywords:
  - emergency routing
  - conformal prediction
  - QUBO
  - QAOA
  - hybrid quantum-classical optimization
